OL,3,GNEWSA'Heartless' scammer vowed to repay
OL,4,Avictims but still hasn't a year on
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictims of a "heartless" fraudster, who
OL,7,Ffaked her own wedding to con relatives
OL,8,Fand friends out of more than #12,000,
OL,9,Fare questioning why they have only
OL,10,Freceived a fraction of what she was
OL,11,Fordered to pay back.
OL,13,FCharlotte Blackwell, 32, from Bridgend,
OL,14,Fwas handed a suspended prison sentence
OL,15,Fand ordered to pay #13,750 in
OL,16,Fcompensation to the four victims by a
OL,17,Fjudge in March 2025.
OL,19,FWhen she realised she would be avoiding
OL,20,Fjail Blackwell sobbed in relief and
OL,21,Fagreed to the judge's demand that she
OL,22,Fpay at a rate of #400 a month.
